              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/GMS-2016-57?s=gitlab&n=sanitize-html&t=npm&vr=%3C%3D1.4.2",
              "help": {
                "text": "Sanitization of HTML strings is not applied recursively to input, allowing an attacker to potentially inject script and other markup.\n",
                "markdown": "> Sanitization of HTML strings is not applied recursively to input, allowing an attacker to potentially inject script and other markup.\n\n|                                             |\n|Package         pkg:npm/sanitize-html@1.4.2  |\n|Affected range  <=1.4.2                      |\n|Fixed version   1.4.3                        |\n"
              },
