            {
              "id": "GMS-2018-10",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "GMS-2018-10: OWASP Top Ten 2017 Category A9 - Using Components with Known Vulnerabilities"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/GMS-2018-10?s=gitlab&n=lodash&t=npm&vr=%3C4.17.5",
              "help": {
                "text": "Functions in Lodash ( merge, mergeWith, defaultsDeep) can modify the prototype of \"Object\" if given malicious data. This can lead to denial of service or remote code execution.\n",
                "markdown": "> Functions in Lodash ( merge, mergeWith, defaultsDeep) can modify the prototype of \"Object\" if given malicious data. This can lead to denial of service or remote code execution.\n\n|                                      |\n|Package         pkg:npm/lodash@2.4.2  |\n|Affected range  <4.17.5               |\n|Fixed version   4.17.5                |\n"
